      "value": "@{5bd4da95a5c5264bf3199faf|full_name}: For what you wanna make a big world? The most of the players are used to it to go everytime in the same worlds like great pug, box or what ever and playing mirror simulator - so there are very less potential players for it, that means it dont worth and VRChat is not developed to create big worlds.\nbtw. if you know how to set up LOD's they work correctly for VR users too, then please tell me how..",
