      "value": "@{5c1419f79358e0212d61c456|full_name}: Most players go to whose worlds because they're the most popular. At the same time, worlds like the great pug are also kinda resource intensive. Lag free box is super light on resources, and that's why it's popular. That doesn't mean you can't set or change the standard for a popular map in VRChat. It has and continues to be done. Just look at the popular tab on any given day, guaranteed there is a new world on there at least once every couple days!",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
